{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から4月。\n東京では桜が見頃を迎えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花見に行きたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春の匂いが好き～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/04/01/9344661/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎3月21日\n全国握手会(京都)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボーダー初披露。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しましたが\n間違えることなく\n踊りきることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は白石さんとペアでした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に\n昇格をお祝いしていただき\n嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/04/01/9344661/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎3月28日\n2期生お誕生日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生の記念日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は卒業したメンバーも含め\n2期生みんなが大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年目もよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/04/01/9344661/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎3月29日\nじょしらくオーディション"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はメンバーが立つ舞台を観に行き\n演技を学びたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昇格組からは琴子と山崎さん\nそして、きぃちゃんとみおちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"typ